{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith","name_zh":"鸣神信仰与鸣神大社","name_en":"Narukami Faith and Shrine","aliases":["鸣神信仰与鸣神大社","Narukami Faith and Shrine"],"category":"culture","scope":"regional","regions":["Inazuma"],"summary":"鸣神大社既是稻妻的神社地点，也是崇奉雷之神、领导鸣神民众信仰的宗教组织。大社以祈愿接待、巫女体系、祭祀典仪以及守护神樱、雷樱和举行神樱大祓为主要职能；神樱则兼具宗教象征与净化土地的实际作用。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_001","text":"“鸣神大社”兼指宗教组织及其同名神社区域；该组织以位于山巅的同名神社为本据。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期；当前仍然如此","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami_faith","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_002","text":"作为宗教组织，鸣神大社崇奉雷之神并领导鸣神民众的信仰；其负责人及现任管理者为 Yae Miko。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_003","text":"作为地点，鸣神大社是稻妻规模最大的神社，供奉以「御建鸣神主尊大御所」等敬称指代的神明，并为前来祈愿的人提供慰藉、求签和祈求祝福的场所。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期；当前仍然如此","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_004","text":"鸣神大社周边不允许动用军事力量，因为这被视为对将军本人的不敬；大社不受 Shogunate 管辖，但仍服从其所崇奉的雷之神的权威。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前制度","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_005","text":"鸣神大社负责协助前来祈祷的访客、守护神樱和雷樱，并主持祭祀及典仪事务，其中包括神樱大祓。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期职责","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_006","text":"除 Watatsumi Island 外，稻妻多数巫女在鸣神大社受训，并最终优先隶属于大社；她们照料各自神社也具有使其与大社保持一致的意义。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期组织惯例","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_007","text":"神樱是位于鸣神大社的神圣树木，具有净化稻妻、抵御深渊污秽侵入的作用；各处雷樱是其旁枝，彼此相连的根系会吸收土地中的污秽。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期；当前仍持续发挥作用","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_008","text":"常开的神樱被描述为鸣神“永恒”的象征；神樱与雷樱也象征雷之神恒久的守望。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期宗教象征","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_009","text":"神樱及雷樱的根系只能吸收而不能自行消解污秽，因此必须定期举行神樱大祓；若污秽持续积聚，根系会遭到腐蚀并形成瘤状物，最终可能使神樱枯萎并给稻妻造成灾难。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"周期性维护规律","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_010","text":"净化仪式分为较频繁的常规净化和每六十年一次的大型净化。前者用于检查根系并设置保护根系与民众的结界；后者先净化雷樱根系，再祓除影向山深处神樱根系多年积聚的瘴晦。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"周期性仪式制度","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_011","text":"神樱的历史具有时间回溯性质：Makoto 将种子交给 Ei 后，Ei 的种植行为使其在稻妻数千年前的过去生根。除未受正常时间流影响的 Ei 外，其他相关人物的记忆均认定神樱一直存在。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"回溯至数千年前；认知差异延续至今","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_faith_fact_012","text":"据九条裟罗陈述，「御建鸣神主尊大御所大人像」曾以限量商品形式发售，不少人从凌晨开始排队；她本人称自己始终以崇敬之心对待此类塑像。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"容彩祭期间的一次发售事件","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"数千年前（由后来的种植行为回溯形成）","order_hint":5,"events":["Makoto 交给 Ei 的种子经由时间回溯在稻妻的远古过去生根，神樱由此开始生长。","除 Ei 外，相关人物的记忆均将神樱视为一直存在。"],"current_status":"神樱延续至今，并持续承担宗教象征、净化与守护作用。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"period":"Archon War 之前","order_hint":10,"events":["鸣神大社已经建成。","Hakushin 担任大社最初的侍奉者。"],"current_status":"大社延续为现存的宗教组织及神社。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]},{"period":"约五百年前","order_hint":20,"events":["大社一度由狐斋宫与 Great Tengu 领导。","狐斋宫死后，Asase Hibiki 接掌大社，后来在 Ako Domeki 的叛乱期间迁回 Asase Shrine。"],"current_status":"这一时期的领导更替已成为大社历史。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]},{"period":"最近一次神樱大祓","order_hint":30,"events":["Traveler 与花散里完成最近一次神樱大祓，净化雷樱与神樱根系中的污秽。","大社原本正在准备仪式，但 Yae Miko 叫停了相关准备，并预先安排将所需物品交给一名金发外来者。"],"current_status":"最近一次大型污秽已经清除，但根系仍会继续吸收污秽，定期净化仍有必要。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03"]},{"period":"当前","order_hint":40,"events":["鸣神大社由 Yae Miko 管理，并继续承担祈愿接待、巫女事务、神樱守护及祭祀典仪等职责。"],"current_status":"大社仍是领导鸣神民众信仰的主要宗教组织，也是稻妻规模最大的神社。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"稻妻民众普遍可将鸣神大社认作供奉雷之神、接受祈愿与求签并守护神樱的主要神社；神樱常开及其象征“永恒”的含义也具有公开宗教意义。","likely_known_by":["稻妻普通居民及参拜者","鸣神大社的巫女与负责人","受鸣神大社训练或管辖的地方巫女","研究神樱、雷樱及净化仪式的宗教人员"],"unlikely_known_by":["缺乏稻妻文化接触的外地普通居民","仅进行普通参拜而未接触仪式内情的人","不知道时间回溯事件的普通神职人员与信众"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["传说神樱的庇护会延伸至其花瓣落到的地方。","稻妻人过去相信神樱通过雷樱净化污秽、守护水土安全。","除 Ei 外，相关人物的记忆均认定神樱自古便一直存在；Ei 对其出现保有不同记忆。"]},"activation_keys":["鸣神信仰与鸣神大社","Narukami Faith and Shrine"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["Grand Narukami Shrine 的七圣召唤支援牌内容。","神樱供奉等级、供奉奖励及 Electrograna 升级机制。","任务开启条件、任务清单、任务奖励及战斗流程。","兴趣点数量、NPC 清单、区域特产、配乐、版本更新和探索移动方式。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["鸣神大社与现实世界神社之间的原型、词源及设计类比。","神樱可能具有自我意识的推测。","神樱根系可能与 Irminsul 融合，以及由此推导出的净化和记忆机理。","Ei 关于 Makoto 的计划可能涉及 Istaroth 的推测。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_inazuma_narukami_faith","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Grand Narukami Shrine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Grand_Narukami_Shrine","language":"en","revision_id":"1622622","source_text_sha256":"3834e66ff901e6fad4e294fd4f26021368582a3ee49f9327dc41233cbd794460"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Grand Narukami Shrine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Grand_Narukami_Shrine_(Faction)","language":"en","revision_id":"1832342","source_text_sha256":"e89e1a407778512ed554dac8112ef87c57852ef607609ce9d4d21bda86835fd1"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Grand Narukami Shrine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Grand_Narukami_Shrine_(Subarea)","language":"en","revision_id":"1857661","source_text_sha256":"866c83b3df4fd26d8b20eb9d1e9ff069a1e1dcc3ca0abbc85bbca0d460bced7a"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Sacred Sakura","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sacred_Sakura","language":"en","revision_id":"1779927","source_text_sha256":"2857ef6a3c0801f3bff3968c77a260784bcb8fe32f0843814d17b33e034749f3"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Sacred Sakura Cleansing Ritual","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sacred_Sakura_Cleansing_Ritual","language":"en","revision_id":"2092245","source_text_sha256":"79596ca2a32f5cb3d3929dc138d1181ea5eb1cc7e01638b01283f01d69850239"},{"source_id":"local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"「御建鸣神主尊大御所大人像」购入须知","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_72280.json#unit=7228001","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"dab62ed18f8e93bac528bac8143fa68183cc6efc71f815efe6c05d4aead525f1"},{"source_id":"local_sup_inazuma_narukami_faith_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"影向祓行","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_72105.json#unit=7210502","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"6aa22964d240ce4b24d18ea4168f469fb566b32982e8317a953e2e69041bab66"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"dbf4daf285139098cfaab568d9933bc8526823c8a095572fd5677d2abe785a95","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["“神樱的庇护延伸至花瓣落到的地方”在来源中以“据说”表述，只能视为流传说法。","九条裟罗对塑像发售、排队情况及自身崇敬态度的描述属于角色陈述。"],"missing_evidence":[],"needs_human_review":false}}